WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:02.230
Once upon a time,

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:06.120
there was a barbaric, ruthless, defiant,

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.730
demon-like bastard who thought 
nothing of his fellow man.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.120
Let's begin.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:20.380
What the hell is Oga doing?

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.250
Who cares? This is our chance!

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.850
Oga punch.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:32.170
Come here, Baby Beel.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.670
Now, Baby Beel... Which one do you like?

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.920
Figures.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:52.970
What do you mean?

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.950
Then... This side? Or this side?

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:56.990
Which do you like?

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:07.500
This baby only likes things 
that no normal kid would like!

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:11.880
Looks like he's into them.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:12.970
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:14.010
Wait!

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:35.500
This is the story of a 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.880
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a child.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:43.940
But this is no ordinary baby... 
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:29.890
<b>Say Hi to the BoB Brawler!</b>

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.520
My body's not gonna hold up at this rate.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:39.000
Why are you bringing him to school anyway?

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.490
Shouldn't you just leave him at home?

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:43.840
My place is off limits... It's 
been taken over by a demon.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.660
And there's no escaping him.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.430
Huh?

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:48.850
My place is even more off limits!

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:51.000
The day before yesterday 
you half destroyed it!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.190
Just listen, Furuichi!

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:58.950
Starting today, this baby and I 
will be living here in your care.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:00.700
My name is Hildegarde.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:04.330
Please think of me as your new daughter.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.240
Whoa! Hold it there!

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:08.640
Don't you think people might 
take that the wrong way?

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:10.760
Is there some problem?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.100
Hell yeah there's a problem!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.980
Everyone's already frozen in shock!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.850
However, I heard that was 
customary in this country...

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:20.320
Says who, damn it?

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.110
Your assumptions are all wrong!

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.820
This country?

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.080
She's from overseas?

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:30.120
Tatsumi brought a girl home with him? 
And she's a blond beauty, to boot!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.250
Her boobs are huge!

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.330
But wait, what is the baby doing...

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.590
I told you already!

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:37.130
I haven't accepted that I'm the father yet!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.380
Father?

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.500
Even after all that you did...

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.330
He did what?!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.360
<b>He did it</b>

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:45.800
It was <i>amazing</i>...

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.410
What?! Tatsumi!

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.310
A punk like you doing those kinds 
of things to a beauty like her...

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:53.520
And you still refuse to accept 
her even after you got a kid?!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.170
W-Wait, that's not it...

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:57.520
What's not it?

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.000
Look at that kid!

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.980
He's yours, now matter how you look at it!

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.150
He's got your eyes!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.350
He ain't got nothin'!

00:05:04.350 --> 00:05:05.280
Are you blind?

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.740
Yes! He's the spitting image.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.780
Let me see here...

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.500
Oh, and such a daring little boy...

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.220
He makes me remember when 
you were little, Tatsumi.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.900
What country are you from?

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:16.830
I'm from Makai (Demon World).

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:17.690
Macao?

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.880
Wow, your Japanese is really good.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:22.520
I do <i>so</i> apologize!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:26.700
I will make sure he takes 
responsibility and raises him!

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:29.850
Hey! Show some damn respect!

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:32.760
I thank you so much for joining our family...

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:35.100
Whoa... Dad did a sliding grovel...

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:36.640
He's had lots of practice.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.610
No, it is I who should be thanking you.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.410
Please, call me Hilda.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.950
And that's how it was.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.400
H-Hold it a sec.

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:49.580
So you're living under the same roof?

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:51.280
With that goth-loli busty babe?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.650
What the heck? What kind of 
romantic comedy setup is this?

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:57.290
Why is it only you, when it's 
my house that's half destroyed?!

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.720
<i>That's</i> what's eating you?

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:01.720
<i>That's</i> what's important!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:03.680
My life's on the line here!

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:05.270
This ain't some pleasure cruise!

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:06.180
Your life?

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:09.040
That's enough, damn you!

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:11.030
How dare you confuse my family like that!

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:13.020
You seriously plan on living 
here? What the hell?

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:17.230
There's nothing to be done about it. 
The Master chose you, after all.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.390
Also, dinner was delicious.

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.310
Stop making yourselves so damn at home!

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:27.820
However, if I take the Master and leave, 
it will be you who is in danger.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:29.990
Why's that?

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.830
The Master requests that you carry him.

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:39.230
Get offa me!

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.040
Such insolence... How dare you!

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:53.270
If he is separated from you, 
the Master throws a tantrum.

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:58.100
The shock wave from the Master's crying 
contains considerable destructive power.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:02.630
A precaution. When the Master 
gets 15 meters away,

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:06.570
you should be warned that the electric 
waves from his voice rise to a fatal level.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.040
That's seriously dangerous!

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:14.330
And that's how it was.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:16.180
Anyway, Oga...

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:19.500
Where did Hilda-san sleep last night?

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.710
Furuichi, you idiot!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.550
But...

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.760
Whoa, you kiddin' me?

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:32.120
He's really got a kid with 
'im. What a piece a work!

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:36.060
See, what'd I tell ya? If we're 
gonna get Oga, now's the time.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:40.770
This distance... 13, no wait, 14.5 meters!

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:40.770
Oga-kun, ya gotta be more careful.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.790
You have to watch the baby 
real close or else...

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.270
Don't move!

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.800
Don't move a step farther away!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:51.400
You move, and I kill you!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.660
How many meters do I got, damn it?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:56.880
Hey look... Oga's breaking into a 
sweat. Still scary as heck though.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.160
Move it, chumps!

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.040
You guys are...

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.540
It's the Twin-Headed Dragon of 
Ishiyama, the Sanada Brothers!

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.540
We'll be the ones to do in Oga!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:07.700
Who?

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.880
Idiot! Those are the second years...

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.420
Hey, now! No running away.

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:16.810
It's Abe, the Killing Machine!

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:20.210
Oh, you did a good number on me before.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:24.320
Hey, don't go forgetting me.

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:26.060
Even Good Night Shimokawa!

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:29.460
What the... All the leaders 
of the second year are here!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.180
Oga, this is lookin' dicey.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:32.990
What a pain...

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.980
Hey, you jerks! Stick closer!

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:35.910
Right!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:36.810
I'm headin' out!

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:37.950
Have a nice day!

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:39.810
Get over here, you!

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:42.830
You chicken?

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:43.800
Come here!

00:08:43.800 --> 00:08:45.560
Oh, yeah?

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.210
Oga "barely 15 meters" punch!

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.960
Hey? Not bad, rookie.

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:53.980
I'll saw you completely in half!

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:57.850
With my secret technique, the Texas Chainsaw!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.970
Die!

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:03.600
Then I'll use...

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.100
Ground pound!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.980
Punch!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.110
A two-fer!

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.870
Uh, we're sor...

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.170
Daddy's home!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.700
Welcome back!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.620
Next time you make off alone 
like that I'll stomp you flat!

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.140
God damn it.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.090
Oh, you're home Tatsumi?

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.860
We already started eating.

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.890
Welcome home, Dear.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:47.680
Why are you all calmly sitting 
around the dinner table?

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.900
Don't chow down on curry like 
we're one happy family, damn it!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:52.770
Hilda-san made this curry!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:55.380
We've got dinner for you too, Beel-chan.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:59.280
She's even good at cooking... She's 
totally wasted on you, Tatsumi.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.280
She's a <i>de-mon</i>!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:06.120
Yes, that's right.  She's 
<i>the one</i> to be your wife...

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.230
Let me fill you up, Father.

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.170
By the way, when is the shiki?

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:14.130
<b>"Shiki" = Ceremony</b>

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.090
Shiki? Are you sure you want to know?

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:17.050
<b>"Shiki" = Time of Death</b>

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.590
Whoa, whoa, hold it!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:23.220
Tatsumi, don't be so cross. 
How about taking a bath first?

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.150
I'll look after Beel-chan for you.

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:29.040
Do not worry. It is 14 meters between 
the bathroom and the living room.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:31.480
As long as you don't go beyond 
that line, you should be fine.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.520
That's cutting it damn close...

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:37.740
Sheesh...

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:44.740
Ciao!

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.910
What the hell are...

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:50.760
You forgot me already?

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.360
I am the dimensional transference 
demon, Alaindelon.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:55.210
That ain't what I asked!

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:56.500
What are you doing in here?

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:59.370
I was asked by Hilda-sama...

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.250
To report the current distance 
between you and the Master.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:05.250
12.7 meters...12.9 meters...

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.690
Ooh... 14.3 meters...

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:10.560
13.9 meters... 13.3 meters...

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:13.770
Oh, oh...! 14.5 meters!

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:16.650
How am I supposed to relax 
in the bath like this?

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.040
Finally asleep...

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.600
That is how it seems.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:23.030
You're still here?

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.480
What are you doing here?

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:34.750
He was loitering around in front 
of the house, so I transfered him.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.820
I was worried about you, see...

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:40.440
Are you really okay living under 
the same roof as Hilda-san?

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:43.800
Be quiet! You will wake the Master.

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:49.460
When you look at him like this, he really 
doesn't look like a baby Demon Lord.

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:54.640
No need to worry. As he grows up, he 
will gain the power to destroy humanity.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.020
Oh, I'm worried all right.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:00.320
Wait, so does that mean like... the future 
of humanity rests on your shoulders?

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:05.170
Haha?

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:16.590
Shut up!

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.170
And hey, why does it have to be me?

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.690
There's got to be plenty 
of other people out there.

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:24.890
Oh, I wouldn't say that.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:28.940
As we discussed the other day, the 
Master is a Demon Lord, you see...

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:31.550
He only cares for those with great strength.

00:12:31.550 --> 00:12:32.900
Well, I suppose I fit that...

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.100
Oh, <i>that</i> he likes.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:37.980
And in addition to that, barbaric, 
ruthless, and defiant bastards

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.940
who think nothing of their 
fellow man are perfect.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:45.660
The stronger and more ruthless the person 
is, the more the Master takes a liking to them.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.650
Wait! Then that means...

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:50.870
If I can find a person more brutal than me, 
then Baby Beel will get attached to him!

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:53.410
I'll be free!

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.880
Such idiots!

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:18.190
My pitiful ones!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.570
I will scramble you good!

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.570
Destruction! Total annihilation!

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.670
He's kind of annoying...

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:27.700
Why does he only rant during our games?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.070
Oh, my bad.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:32.540
I ain't slept for a week, so 
I'm kinda hopped up, ya know?

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.530
I'm real sorry everybody!

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:36.370
But you'll forgive me 'cause 
I'm the Great Demon Lord!

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.000
Great Demon Lord...

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.880
Yo, wazzap.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.090
How's the child rearin' coming?

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:45.130
My son looking like he'll destroy humanity?

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:49.190
Well, for the time being, this man 
has become Lord Beelze's father.

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:53.720
He's got a pretty barbaric face there. Nice.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.530
Ooh, ron!

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:58.770
I gots a three closed triples with 
straw dolls, 5 nails, and hammers!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:02.580
Oh, yes... My son's favorite toy.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:04.510
I totally forgot to hand it over.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.030
Can you send it DeadEx?

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.100
Where...

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.420
Where is he...

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:20.910
Where's a bastard that's stronger 
and more brutal than me?

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:21.920
Is it you?!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.250
No way, man!

00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:28.270
How 'bout you? You bad?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:29.880
N-Not at all, dude!

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:33.690
Look at that!

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:34.620
It's the Rampaging Ogre!

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:35.640
No! I mean, on top of him!

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:41.050
Ewwww!

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:42.400
Something smells...

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.550
He didn't....

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:47.280
That ain't somethin' you do on 
people's heads, god damn it!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.410
Hilda-san! What brings you here?

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.680
I received an express delivery 
from the Demon World,

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:01.180
and have brought it immediately 
to give to the Master.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:05.170
Where is Oga Tatsumi?

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.670
Oga's off searching for someone strong.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.680
That man has a hard time giving up.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:15.310
Hey, girly... How'd you 
like to go a round with me?

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.830
Who the hell are you?

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.940
I say, Good Night to those eyes of yours...

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:30.970
Good Night!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.550
What was that?

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:36.400
Too strong!

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:38.660
That one's brutal!

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.670
There's someone strong over there?

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.130
Oga Tatsumi... So that's where you were.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.520
What the hell is this all about?

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:50.470
Well...

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:53.680
You've decided to take him and leave, right?

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:57.140
Wait a second! Don't cry! Don't do it!

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.290
It sure makes an awful racket.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:30.040
What nonsense. It's a lovely 
sound that pleases the Master.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.300
Anyway, have you found someone 
stronger and more brutal than you?

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.010
No, not yet.

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:42.620
Isn't there some Great Demon Lord 
that rules this god-forsaken place?

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:43.640
That's it!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.160
If you're talking about the Lord of a 
school, then you mean the Principal!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.480
I see! I suppose you could think that way.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.070
I dunno what the guy's like,

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:54.540
but if he's the Principal of the worst 
school in the country, he's gotta be strong!

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:56.490
I'm sure that Baby Beel will take to him!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.170
In here...

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:05.740
Who knows how frightful 
this Principal will be?

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:06.710
Here I go, Furuichi...

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:21.810
You're the Principal?

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:27.480
Yeah, in a way, you gotta have balls to be 
the Principal of this school wearing that...

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.870
What is it now?

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:56.570
The Master is hungry. I believe 
I prepared lunch for him.

00:17:58.100 --> 00:17:59.300
Where is it?

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:01.850
It was in the classroom you destroyed!

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:03.850
You left it there?

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:05.460
Hold it!

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:07.600
This is where you nurse him with those...

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:14.050
The Master prefers the milk from 
the nine-headed King Hydra,

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:17.090
who took the lives of 6.6 million 
residents of the Demon World.

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:18.360
Yeah, I don't got that.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:21.120
The closest thing in the 
human world would be...

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.340
Move it.

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:27.120
This.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.170
<b>The Milk</b>

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:28.510
Cow's milk?

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.130
I gots it!

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.460
Hold it, you!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.600
Listen up, Baby Beel.

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:08.800
A man can't go crying so easily.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.780
Plus, you're a Demon Lord!

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.050
No, not "da".

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:16.780
Do you really understand?

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:25.310
The tougher it gets, the less a 
man should cry. Do you know why?

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:32.700
Because tears wash away 
the pain and suffering.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:35.440
But those emotions become weapons 
when you truly need them.

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:41.400
So that's why you can't 
just go off like that.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:46.130
When you want to cry, laugh it off! 
That's what being a man is, got it?

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:54.460
Baby Beel!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.000
We gots yer kid!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.530
Why, you...

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:01.550
If he gets more than 15 
meters away, I'm dead meat!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.010
No way! We're going 50 kilometers an hour!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:08.670
This guy's unreal!

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.060
Don't cry!

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.110
You have 3 meters!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:22.550
2.9... 2.8... 2.7...

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:24.050
What are you doing here?

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:26.460
Please, use me!

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:28.360
Now!

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:36.710
What the...

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.310
Dude, the big guy's messed up...

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:58.820
Pop!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:01.070
Pop?

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:13.410
Nice one. Seems like you didn't cry.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.730
Oga, you bastard...

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:17.810
We won't forgive you!

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.370
Here we go!

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:33.100
Demon Lord Punch!

00:21:44.420 --> 00:21:45.490
Let's go home.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:11.430
I am <i>so</i> gonna stick him with someone else!

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:16.190
He's still got a lot to learn.

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:08.760
Damn it all... I'm stuck with him.

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:13.440
What's so bad about it? You get to live 
together with Hilda! I wanna live with Hilda!

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:17.220
If you are really so envious 
about that, I'll think about it.

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:19.280
Really, Hilda-san?

00:24:20.520 --> 00:24:25.020
Next time on Beelzebub: "Are there any 
strong, ruthless bastards around here?"

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:26.970
Are you talking about me?

00:24:27.410 --> 00:24:28.030
Who?
